1
00:00:00,037 --> 00:00:02,917
(Waiter:)...maybe I get bumped,
one of the dumplings fall to the floor.

2
00:00:03,082 --> 00:00:04,122
No one has to know.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,090
(Sheldon:)I'll know.

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,420
[SPEAKING IN CHINESE]

5
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:15,550
- How about soup?
- Yeah, we can always divide soup.

6
00:00:15,719 --> 00:00:17,219
What about the won tons?

7
00:00:23,519 --> 00:00:25,229
(Penny(answering):)Oh. Hey, guys, what's up?

8
00:00:25,396 --> 00:00:27,396
It's "Halo" night.

9
00:00:28,232 --> 00:00:29,652
Yeah? Okay.

10
00:00:31,402 --> 00:00:32,862
(Leonard:)So?

11
00:00:33,362 --> 00:00:36,362
(Leonard:)With Wolowitz spending all of his time
with your friend Christy...

12
00:00:36,532 --> 00:00:40,532
(Penny:)She's not my friend. Friends do not
get their friends' Care Bears all sweaty.

13
00:00:41,537 --> 00:00:45,327
(Leonard:)Right, anyway, uh,
with Wolowitz occupied elsewhere...

14
00:00:45,499 --> 00:00:47,919
(Leonard:)...we had something
we wanted to ask you.

15
00:00:48,085 --> 00:00:50,005
(Leonard:)- Sheldon?
- Yes. Ahem.

16
00:00:52,798 --> 00:00:55,798
(Leonard(opening door):)Penny,
we would very much appreciate it...

17
00:00:55,968 --> 00:00:58,598
(Sheldon:)...if you would be the fourth member
of our "Halo" team.

18
00:00:59,555 --> 00:01:05,025
(Sheldon:)I don't think I need to tell you
what an honor this is.

